# The two-lock and bank modes for iomoon -- the sequences the Monolith walk and
# the multiball capture cannot reach.
#
# All in ONE ball, which the drop bank makes possible: it starts standing and
# resets only at ball start (rules 3.3.6), so flattening it mid-ball is what
# arms Special Drop Probe AND what turns the second Jupiter lock into Wonderful
# Thing rather than Multiball (rules 3.3.7).  No drain is needed and none is
# scripted -- a drain here would put the bank back up and undo both.
#
# Order, and why:
#   1. ORBITS x6 (lane 4 then bull's-eye 1).  Jupiter retains nothing until
#      [413C:0102] reaches its cap of 6, so every lock below depends on it.
#   2. All five drop targets, then the inner target.  With the bank already
#      flat, the inner target starts SPECIAL DROP PROBE: LP7, LP8 and LP9 all
#      light for 10 s and only LP8 is left when it expires (rules 3.2.7/3.3.6).
#   3. Jupiter lock 1, its replacement ball, then Jupiter lock 2 -- with the
#      bank down this is WONDERFUL THING, not Multiball (rules 3.2.2), and its
#      own distinguishing shot is Ramp 2, which lights lane 8's extra ball and
#      releases the held balls one after another rather than together.
#   4. Both shooters, which alternate LPA11 / LPA12, Lagrange Scape and
#      Lagrange Orbit -- the Monolith pair that is never cashed (rules 3.3.4).
#
# Needs a seeded NVRAM with credits -- see dmd/multiball/README.md.
500 mark boot
560 tap 12 KEYCODE_1
620 mark start
900 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
960 mark plunge
1200 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1208 mark orbits-lane4-1
1260 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1268 mark orbits-letter-1
1350 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1358 mark orbits-lane4-2
1410 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1418 mark orbits-letter-2
1500 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1508 mark orbits-lane4-3
1560 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1568 mark orbits-letter-3
1650 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1658 mark orbits-lane4-4
1710 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1718 mark orbits-letter-4
1800 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1808 mark orbits-lane4-5
1860 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
1868 mark orbits-letter-5
1950 tap 6 KEYCODE_S
1958 mark orbits-lane4-6
2010 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_B
2018 mark orbits-letter-6
2100 mark orbits-complete
2250 mark bank-start
2250 tap 6 KEYCODE_Z
2258 mark drop-target-1
2340 tap 6 KEYCODE_X
2348 mark drop-target-2
2430 tap 6 KEYCODE_C
2438 mark drop-target-3
2520 tap 6 KEYCODE_V
2528 mark drop-target-4
2610 tap 6 KEYCODE_N
2618 mark drop-target-5
2820 tap 6 KEYCODE_I
2828 mark special-drop-probe
3620 mark probe-expired
3770 tap 6 KEYCODE_J
3778 mark wonderful-lock-1
4070 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
4078 mark wonderful-replacement-1
4330 tap 6 KEYCODE_J
4338 mark wonderful-thing-lock-2
4650 tap 8 KEYCODE_SPACE
4658 mark wonderful-replacement-2
4930 tap 6 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_R
4938 mark wonderful-ramp2
5630 tap 6 KEYCODE_LCONTROL,KEYCODE_MINUS
5638 mark shooter-left-lagrange
5890 tap 6 KEYCODE_RCONTROL,KEYCODE_MINUS
5898 mark shooter-right-lagrange
6390 mark end
6540 quit
